KORTEX PAST EXAMINATION PAPERS
JAMB - Mathematics (Year 2024)

Q1. Find the derivative dy/dx of y = (3x^2 - 2x + 1)^4.
  (A) 4(6x - 2)(3x^2 - 2x + 1)^3
  (B) (6x - 2)(3x^2 - 2x + 1)^3
  (C) 4(3x^2 - 2x + 1)^3
  (D) (12x - 8)(3x^2 - 2x + 1)^4
  Answer: A - Chain rule: dy/dx = 4(3x^2 - 2x + 1)^3 * (6x - 2).


